0..63 Comment "//! This source proves protocol equivalence with payload paths."
64..67 Comment "//!"
68..118 Comment "//! Two protocols can encode messages differently."
119..162 Comment "//! Each unequal payload pair needs a path."
163..223 Comment "//! The session certificate carries each path to the kernel."
224..273 Comment "//! Bisimilarity follows the payload equivalence."
274..324 Comment "//! Gay and Hole relate payloads by type equality."
325..328 Comment "//!"
329..379 Comment "//! A path generalises equality to an equivalence."
380..443 Comment "//! `Path.bisim` checks one path for each unequal payload pair."
